   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Draw your ideas in the boxes, roughly: lines, shapes or the pencil (P). Each box is the 64 × 64 grid of the marks\n(one square = 8 units). Claude Code draws the ones you keep again, in clean SVG, into the mock-up.\nThe examples below can be moved, changed or deleted. Save with Ctrl+S before telling Claude Code.",
   "originalText": "Draw your ideas in the boxes, roughly: lines, shapes or the pencil (P). Each box is the 64 × 64 grid of the marks\n(one square = 8 units). Claude Code draws the ones you keep again, in clean SVG, into the mock-up.\nThe examples below can be moved, changed or deleted. Save with Ctrl+S before telling Claude Code.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
